		{
			dependencies: [
				"2B825471FE41A521"
				"731126727DDCAC54"
				"7CFA560528061851"
			]
			description: [
				"&6I have heard whispers, giving me the secret recipe to make an artefact called the Red Sigil. I do not know what it will do."
				""
				"&6The whispers tell me to find a fractured clocktower. Where could one ever be? Have I ever seen one?"
			]
			id: "350B7C05222BA4D6"
			rewards: [{
				id: "587095537BFB21E4"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			subtitle: "Whispering Echoes"
			tasks: [{
				id: "043E83FA70C1AA6C"
				item: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:sigil_of_the_red_sun"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -1.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["350B7C05222BA4D6"]
			description: [
				"&6Once arriving at the Fractured Clocktower, I did not seem to find anything at first. The place was completely decrepid and actively collapsing, although the blooming vines were noteworthy. "
				""
				"&6I found this \"Oddment\" on the upper floors. My Sigil was naturally attracted to it, summoning forth a strange creature by the name of Linara."
			]
			id: "5F1A4E7BC374062C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3CDA151BB65134E8"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				icon: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:oddment_stage_2"
				id: "6A2023507BC12462"
				structure: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:fractured_clock_tower"
				title: "Visit the Fractured Clock Tower"
				type: "structure"
			}]
			x: -1.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["523CD93EE762B31F"]
			description: [
				"&6Saphyra is an interesting being. She is old, as much as her appearance may tell otherwise. She may very well be several centuries old, seeing as she recounts having survived the \"Day of the White Flame\", whatever that means. "
				""
				"&6I've never heard of such an event in written records. More interestingly, she seems to have survived the much more recent Endless Night, which had wiped out most of the human population."
			]
			id: "74E84F1EE6428017"
			rewards: [{
				id: "07515615BB41F952"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			subtitle: "The Arch-Witch"
			tasks: [{
				icon: {
					Count: 1
					id: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:saphyras_hat_helmet"
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				id: "468365B2899E1665"
				structure: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:the_three_hallowed_towers"
				title: "Visit the Three Hallowed Towers"
				type: "structure"
			}]
			x: -5.0d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F1A4E7BC374062C"]
			description: ["&6It seems I have been invited. Invited to what? Invited for what? Is it just fate? I'll have to find this creature's master to get to know more."]
			id: "523CD93EE762B31F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "41ED8095082A055E"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "62657D1F74F5C81C"
					item: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:invitation_to_the_hallowed_tower"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "604ADDE88EBB804F"
					item: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:hallowed_key_1"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			x: -3.5d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74E84F1EE6428017"]
			description: [
				"&6Saphyra sent me to find this odd \"Church of the Oath Pus\". I've never heard of such a religion, so it must be quite ancient. I have no true intention of joining her small creed, but I will still investigate for the whispers keep pushing me forward, telling me that this is the way to ascension."
				""
				"&6The main entrance seems closed tightly shut. At least the statue at the center was able to repair my broken Red Sigil. I found a side entrance through a collapsed wall. Let's see what's up there."
			]
			id: "7028FEBF5709ABCE"
			rewards: [{
				id: "057E2039557181CD"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			subtitle: "Church of Oath Pus"
			tasks: [{
				id: "665159CE3F3DA006"
				item: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:key_4"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -5.0d
			y: -8.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4500ED4931EC035D"]
			description: ["&6After fighting through these heretical things and finding my way to the top once again, I acquired a gigantic key for the main entrance. Let us face this puny gatekeeper."]
			id: "57F8D3DFC2D19D0E"
			rewards: [{
				id: "575D2DAE0C3341F0"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
