			dependencies: ["57F8D3DFC2D19D0E"]
			description: [
				"&6The Gatekeeper wasn't that strong. I could have simply consumed his flesh... or rather bones... with one strike."
				""
				"&6These strange effects and curses looked dangerous, but they were completely ineffective on me."
