		{
			dependencies: [
				"731126727DDCAC54"
				"2B825471FE41A521"
				"524067700E07EB06"
				"306BF4B67F2C9AC2"
			]
			description: [
				"The World is the final major arcana of the tarot, symbolizing completion. The World arcana is capable of anything, of every starting Pathway, and of time dilation around itself."
				""
				"The World card is crafted from every single tarot card, excluding itself. The Error card uses the Aeon singularity to fool the world into recognizing The Fool card, numbered 0, as the World, numbered 22, the last of the arcana."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6While Eleonore was aware of the rumored legendary existence of this arcana, there is no evidence at all she could have never reached it. After all, she never reached Justice, nor did she ever witness the closure of the dimensional doors. I think what everyone had missed up until that point was the purity of the glowing gold used. Scintillate is the most pure form of that material. In fact, glowing gold is mere artificial scintillate made in imitation of a deity's gift. "
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: false
			hide_until_deps_visible: false
