		{
			dependencies: ["0F3237156DE95B07"]
			description: [
				"&6The World Devourer is my most foolish endeavour yet. It contains the power of everything in existence, contained within a barrel. I draped gold fabric over it and it's now the most mystical and exotic posession I have. Makes for a good magic trick. Everytime it's broken, new items pop up."
				""
				"&6Paradoxically, I can forsee that if I keep breaking this gambling box, I'll get an \"exalted\" version of this world devourer. Whatever that means."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
