		{
			dependencies: ["0F3237156DE95B07"]
			description: [
				"&6Quantum armour is one of the most powerful sets of armour born from technological progress. Using some blueprints from that ancient civilization &2Prudence &6had researched, I was able to recreate something powerful, but I don't think I quite recreated the true quantum armour. Mine is purple for a start."
				""
				"&6As long as this armour is powered, it effectively provides true invincibility on top of being modular for all sorts of upgrades and having access to digital storage systems within the armour itself."
			]
			id: "05F0DD0273CB3B5A"
