		{
			dependencies: ["57AA488933BCD954"]
			description: [
				"&6I have retrieved his Memory and Saphyra has told me to bother her student, Marlene. She wants a book she hasn't seen before? Well, there's surely plenty of those, but I'd have to go back to civilization. This place is in the middle of nowhere. "
				""
				"&6This made me think I really haven't taken a look at the other towers before. Perhaps they contain some treasures. Atop one of these towers, I found this \"Oddment\" once again. She told me to return to that damned cathedral and retrieve some eye. I've had to go back between this church and these towers so many damn times! I'll just kill them all!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&6Back at the cathedral, I got slightly distracted and found this \"Tale of the Artificial God\", which seems oddly familiar to me. That's actually what I've been looking for! I don't think Marlene has read this book."
			]
			id: "7458D4B28DB7E331"
			rewards: [{
				id: "408A4D50F413FB80"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "48982E4871820E96"
				item: "mokels_bossfight_saphyra:nameless_gatekeeper_remembrance"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 3.0d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7458D4B28DB7E331"]
			description: [
				"&6One day, Saphyra looked down on me in horror. She called me a Demiurge... But aren't you one yourself, she who has attained the power of an Aeon? It must be that she wants to stop me. She invited me to gaze upon the stars once more, but I can forsee a trap."
				""
				"&o\"If a powerful and ancient witch dares to stand on your path to ascending to an Aeon, will you still face her?\""
				""
				"&6Yes."
			]
			id: "306BF4B67F2C9AC2"
			rewards: [{
